Mutation mut_fdi_r16 (not a main fix): lp_wake_req drops when lp_state_req goes
to Active in Reset, so the new FDI-R16 checker must fire.
Applied to a build-time copy of RTL/ by make build ESCAPE=mut_fdi_r16.

--- a/RTL/AOU_FDI_BRINGUP_CTRL.sv
+++ b/RTL/AOU_FDI_BRINGUP_CTRL.sv
@@ -371,7 +371,6 @@
             case (w_nxt_st)
                 ST_WAKE_ASSERT,
                 ST_WAKE_WAIT_ACK,
-                ST_REQ_ACTIVE,
                 ST_ACTIVE,
                 ST_RETRAIN:      r_wake_req <= 1'b1;
                 default:         r_wake_req <= 1'b0;
